omx-dsp (0.13.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * magnitude: omx_eq_curve_freqs builds under -Werror without OMX_CONTRACTS
    (#86)
  * Version 0.13.0 (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * test: the EQ arms fail against nine sabotaged copies of the design and
    curve (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * test: the EQ design and curve against what openmixer dac7b0d computes, at
    the nine RME rates (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * tools: ts-golden.mjs design runs core's, the web surface's and the
    catalog's EQ maths for the parity table (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * test: the EQ bank, head filters and drawn curve against their closed
    forms at the nine RME rates (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * magnitude: a band's magnitude and the drawn curve, core's
    biquadMagnitudeDb and eqCurveDb, the web surface's eqStateBands and
    magnitudeSumDb (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * eq-design: the bank and the head filters, omx_eq_bank_design and
    omx_eq_pass_design, core's eqCoeffs and passFilterCoeffs
    (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * eq-design: omx_eq_octaves_q, the analogue width-to-Q law, the catalog's
    octavesToQ (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * eq-design: omx_eq_complement, the 1 - H section over the same poles,
    core's complementSection (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * magnitude: the unit-circle evaluation without the Nyquist clamp,
    omx_biquad_magnitude_db_w (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * BUILDING: the EQ maths openmixer's TypeScript computes, its C symbols and
    the parity table (FreeMixer/openmixer#1601)
  * Add a selftest for the release workflow's arm gate

